## Checklist before shipping dashboard changes

- [ ] Duplicate **same phone** on form → **login / existing desk**, not a second account.
- [ ] Client dashboard shows **name**, **contact**, **itinerary**, **three service** actions.
- [ ] Admin **price** updates **portal** + **email** in one coherent flow.
- [ ] Copy mentions only the **three** services above unless product expands.

